From b150000000000000000000000000000000000002 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Parcel Play OS <kernel@parcel.invalid>
Date: Tue, 18 Aug 2026 02:01:00 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] amd64: add PARCEL-LAB diagnostic kernel configuration

Add an opt-in amd64 laboratory configuration combining GENERIC-DEBUG with
boot timing and coverage. It is not intended for production.

Signed-off-by: Parcel Play OS <kernel@parcel.invalid>
---
 sys/amd64/conf/PARCEL-LAB | 10 ++++++++++
 1 file changed, 10 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 sys/amd64/conf/PARCEL-LAB

diff --git a/sys/amd64/conf/PARCEL-LAB b/sys/amd64/conf/PARCEL-LAB
new file mode 100644
index 000000000000..b15000000003
--- /dev/null
+++ b/sys/amd64/conf/PARCEL-LAB
@@ -0,0 +1,10 @@
+# SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-2-Clause
+# Diagnostic kernel for Parcel experiments.  Do not deploy in production.
+include GENERIC-DEBUG
+
+ident		PARCEL-LAB
+
+options 	TSLOG
+options 	TSLOGSIZE=262144
+options 	COVERAGE
+options 	KCOV
-- 
2.43.0
